      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain-boundary tungsten will form a coherent, ductile intergranular complexion.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention may produce fine secondary phases that pin crack-initiation sites.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tungsten segregation will increase intergranular cohesion and fracture toughness by mitigating crack initiation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Limiting tungsten to 1–2 at% will avoid significantly altering the bulk caloric phase transformation.",
